Beltworks modifies Simple Conveyor Belts' code and textures. Every change
since the fork point, the 26.1.2 branch (commit 92a97c3), is in this
repository's git history. Which files still carry that work, and under
which license, is marked in each file's SPDX header or in REUSE.toml.

Simple Conveyor Belts credits its textures with this note, kept here word
for word:

    Conveyor textures are based on modified assets from [malcolriley’s unused-textures repo](https://github.com/malcolmriley/unused-textures).
